            </note>
            <note corresp="#d731-f2" n="2" xml:id="d731-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1311">p. 1311</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d731-f3" n="3" xml:id="d731-f3-content">
                <p>Isao Kawada.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d731-f4" n="4" xml:id="d731-f4-content">
                <p>On September 7, upon receipt of approval of this text by Messrs. Rusk and Dulles,
                    the Department forwarded it to Taipei as telegram 220, repeated to Tokyo as 401
                    (693.94/9–751).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
